  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-1",
      "transcript": "A Venus flytrap has no brain. Yet a touch can leave a fading memory.",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.9,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.df63e132a3f305b07bc6d999bf48e80b4025fcabc1b7fd78263016f4e1981285",
        "sha256": "df63e132a3f305b07bc6d999bf48e80b4025fcabc1b7fd78263016f4e1981285"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-2",
      "transcript": "A brief bend of a sensitive hair can send an electrical signal through the trap while it stays open.",
      "start": 5.266666666666667,
      "duration": 6.475,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.19d93489b6e69dea2c035cac35cbbe796aeb88fe0e36f5a35e8fae8b2cd74d7b",
        "sha256": "19d93489b6e69dea2c035cac35cbbe796aeb88fe0e36f5a35e8fae8b2cd74d7b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Alongside that signal, calcium rises inside the leaf’s cells.",
      "start": 12.333333333333334,
      "duration": 4.45,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.e43cb9dcc2a8acb3d324456b1cef67b09bc8853016a0e47b829dcfd6b9d82231",
        "sha256": "e43cb9dcc2a8acb3d324456b1cef67b09bc8853016a0e47b829dcfd6b9d82231"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-4",
      "transcript": "Then the calcium level falls. For a short time, part of that change remains.",
      "start": 17.1,
      "duration": 5.15,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.bfdfef580814306d3e3eae33f0b209bb4b849bab5aed1cdae1a0bfcd1c8a9aeb",
        "sha256": "bfdfef580814306d3e3eae33f0b209bb4b849bab5aed1cdae1a0bfcd1c8a9aeb"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Another signal arriving soon enough raises the level further. If it reaches the level needed for closure, the trap can snap shut.",
      "start": 22.966666666666665,
      "duration": 8.3,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.28e9bb05f0b5ae061b97e7fc5badf4026093739db64fc0a10ce5cd1605078fea",
        "sha256": "28e9bb05f0b5ae061b97e7fc5badf4026093739db64fc0a10ce5cd1605078fea"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-6",
      "transcript": "Wait too long, and the next signal may no longer reach that level.",
      "start": 32.1,
      "duration": 4.275,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.0e8d4b72ccf1508b3d83888c7a7d1b431dc3e1cbf12148c3cdffe34fcd34311c",
        "sha256": "0e8d4b72ccf1508b3d83888c7a7d1b431dc3e1cbf12148c3cdffe34fcd34311c"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-7",
      "transcript": "Two signals don’t always mean two touches: one slower hair movement can produce both.",
      "start": 37.06666666666667,
      "duration": 5.65,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.788716c0dd28f6af2a0c03a73ed71116d2d1b807ddb0fb69d09b5b891dc208de",
        "sha256": "788716c0dd28f6af2a0c03a73ed71116d2d1b807ddb0fb69d09b5b891dc208de"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flytrap-cue-8",
      "transcript": "Here, memory means retained information—a fading chemical state, not conscious recollection.",
      "start": 43.333333333333336,
      "duration": 6.525,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.9748ed17587bfeb3e3fbbf5c19449dce65c3d990865df9f06f13885b38b484b1",
        "sha256": "9748ed17587bfeb3e3fbbf5c19449dce65c3d990865df9f06f13885b38b484b1"
      }
    }
  ],
